flowchart TD
    A["代理宣称『已完成』（Agent claims done）"] --> B{"证据来自谁？（Who produced the evidence?）"}
    B -- "来自代理自述：只是信心不是证据" --> C["不接受（Not accepted）"]
    B -- "来自外部源" --> D["查验证明物（Inspect the proof artifact）"]
    C --> D
    D --> E["测试、视觉 diff、录屏、日志、人工验收（Tests, diffs, video, logs, sign-off）"]
    E --> F{"证明物持久且可查证？（Durable and inspectable?）"}
    F -- "否" --> D
    F -- "是" --> G["验收成立（Claim established）"]
    G --> H["信任可复核，无需重新推导（Institutional memory kept）"]
    classDef core fill:#1a5fd0,stroke:#12449e,color:#ffffff;
    classDef gate fill:#fdf0ef,stroke:#e0b4b4,color:#8a3a34;
    classDef out fill:#edf1f7,stroke:#c9d6e6,color:#182430;
    class C,D,E core;
    class B,F gate;
    class A,G,H out;
